OL,3,A'No nation left behind' says Burnham
OL,4,Aafter meeting first ministers in
OL,5,AGlasgow
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe prime minister has said the UK's
OL,8,Ffour nations must "move together" to
OL,9,Fdevolve more power to regions and
OL,10,Fcities, following a meeting with the
OL,11,FScottish and Welsh first ministers in
OL,12,FGlasgow.
OL,14,FAndy Burnham said he wanted to ensure
OL,15,Fno nation was "left behind" after the
OL,16,Fsit-down, which also included
OL,17,Frepresentatives from Northern Ireland.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
